 * /mfl-league-themes — a public service page on the shared host, indexable on
 * purpose. Copy: src/data/mfl-services.ts; the before-and-after gallery is
 * SeasonalThemeGallery. Like the other service pages it belongs to
 * mfl.football alone and 404s under a league apex.
 */
